    "text": "KDRV\nwebsite\nSiskiyou County, California\nMachado Fire lined at just under three acres in Montague\nBy Liv Collom,\n5 hours agoSISKIYOU COUNTY, Calif. – UPDATE 4:59 p.m.: The Machado Fire is burning in the Big Springs neighborhood in Montague, on the 9600 block of Montana Lane. The vegetation fire is about 2.7 acres, per CAL FIRE Siskiyou Unit. Forward progress has been stopped. You can find your evacuation zone...",
